Send document link in SMS
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/doc/sms
Request
Body

application/json

sid
string
Session ID

doctype
string
required
Document type

docnum
integer
required
Document number

orig
boolean
Original if true, copy if false.

hidenis
boolean
Hide ILS prices from document (only show foreign currency). Applicable only for documents in foreign currency and for languages other then he.

sms_lang
string
SMS language. This also affects the language of the document version. If not passed, current session language (API lang) will be used.

sms_to
string
sms TO. If empty, assume sms_to_client is true

sms_to_client
boolean
Send sms to default client mobile number?

sms_to_creator
boolean
Send sms to document creator?

sms_to_me
boolean
Send sms to authenticated user?

sms_prefix
string
Prefix for sms text. Will appear before document link. name + document type + number

sms_comment
string
Additional comment to place in the sms body.

Responses
200
OK

request sample http
POST /api/v3.php/doc/sms HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Host: api.icount.co.il
Content-Length: 324

{
  "sid": "string",
  "doctype": "string",
  "docnum": 0,
  "orig": true,
  "hidenis": true,
  "sms_lang": "string",
  "sms_to": "string",
  "sms_to_client": true,
  "sms_to_creator": true,
  "sms_to_me": true,
  "sms_prefix": "string",
  "sms_comment": "string"
}
